  "content": {
    "id": "p17-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Simplify:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{(x+5)(x+3)}{(x+5)}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x+3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(x+5)(x+3)}{x+5}&=x+3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{x^2-x-6}{x^2-8x+15}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+2}{x-5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-x-6}{x^2-8x+15}&=\\frac{(x-3)(x+2)}{(x-3)(x-5)}\\\\\\frac{x^2-x-6}{x^2-8x+15}&=\\frac{x+2}{x-5}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{x^2+7x+10}{x^2+6x+8}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+5}{x+4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+7x+10}{x^2+6x+8}&=\\frac{(x+5)(x+2)}{(x+2)(x+4)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+7x+10}{x^2+6x+8}&=\\frac{x+5}{x+4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{(x+3)(3x+1)}{x^2+6x+9}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3x+1}{x+3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(x+3)(3x+1)}{x^2+6x+9}&=\\frac{(x+3)(3x+1)}{(x+3)^2}\\\\\\frac{(x+3)(3x+1)}{x^2+6x+9}&=\\frac{3x+1}{x+3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{3x^2-7x+2}{x^2-4x+4}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3x-1}{x-2}$\n\nSplit the middle term, factorise by grouping, then cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-7x+2&=3x^2-6x-x+2\\\\3x^2-7x+2&=3x(x-2)-(x-2)\\\\3x^2-7x+2&=(3x-1)(x-2)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^2-7x+2}{x^2-4x+4}&=\\frac{(3x-1)(x-2)}{(x-2)^2}\\\\\\frac{3x^2-7x+2}{x^2-4x+4}&=\\frac{3x-1}{x-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{9x^2-4}{12x-8}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3x+2}{4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{9x^2-4}{12x-8}&=\\frac{(3x-2)(3x+2)}{4(3x-2)}\\\\\\frac{9x^2-4}{12x-8}&=\\frac{3x+2}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{8x^2+5x-3}{x^2-1}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{8x-3}{x-1}$\n\nSplit the middle term, factorise by grouping, then cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8x^2+5x-3&=8x^2+8x-3x-3\\\\8x^2+5x-3&=8x(x+1)-3(x+1)\\\\8x^2+5x-3&=(8x-3)(x+1)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{8x^2+5x-3}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{(8x-3)(x+1)}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\\\\\frac{8x^2+5x-3}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{8x-3}{x-1}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q8-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$$\\frac{3x^2+x-2}{3x^2+4x-4}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+1}{x+2}$\n\nFactorise both quadratics by splitting their middle terms, then cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2+x-2&=3x^2+3x-2x-2\\\\3x^2+x-2&=3x(x+1)-2(x+1)\\\\3x^2+x-2&=(3x-2)(x+1)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}3x^2+4x-4&=3x^2+6x-2x-4\\\\3x^2+4x-4&=3x(x+2)-2(x+2)\\\\3x^2+4x-4&=(3x-2)(x+2)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^2+x-2}{3x^2+4x-4}&=\\frac{(3x-2)(x+1)}{(3x-2)(x+2)}\\\\\\frac{3x^2+x-2}{3x^2+4x-4}&=\\frac{x+1}{x+2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 90
      }
    ]
  },
